>## Convert a bigint to an integer value of a given type (note: lossy)
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term bigintToIntegerValue = λit,bi.cases(model.IntegerType){`bigint`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`bigint` = bi}, `int8`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`int8` = literals.bigintToInt8 bi}, `int16`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`int16` = literals.bigintToInt16 bi}, `int32`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`int32` = literals.bigintToInt32 bi}, `int64`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`int64` = literals.bigintToInt64 bi}, `uint8`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`uint8` = literals.bigintToUint8 bi}, `uint16`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`uint16` = literals.bigintToUint16 bi}, `uint32`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`uint32` = literals.bigintToUint32 bi}, `uint64`=λ`_`.model.IntegerValue{`uint64` = literals.bigintToUint64 bi}} it
